t have to be there right on time for the whole three hours (so there is a a
 
ccumulative prize) Your hostess with the mostess Stephanie Marie the Tennes
 
see MC - aka @jiffy_caftan - is bringing a night of two rounds of trivia - 
 
general related and Country related\, including music and photographic clue
 
s...AND a little BINGO with @shunakamuramusic - filled with lots of fun and
 
