SUMMARY:Troy Roberts Quartet - A Tribute to Stanley Turrentine
LOCATION:Birdland Theater\, Hell's Kitchen
DESCRIPTION:Tonight\, Troy Roberts and his quartet comprised of some of the
 
 most in-demandmusicians on the scene\, will celebrate the music of the ten
 
or saxophone titan\,Stanley Turrentine. Join us for an exclusive musical ti
 
p of the hat to one ofRoberts greatest saxophone influences\, as this world
 
-class quartet delves into thesoulful side of Jazz.Embracing his love for a
 
 vast variety of stylistic genres\, three-time GRAMMYnominated saxophonist\
 
, Troy Roberts is quickly becoming one of the most widelyrecorded touring a
 
rtists of his time. As a go-to first call saxophonist\, his nameadorns seve
 
ral essential recordings ranging from the legendary Joey DeFrancesco\,the i
 
conic Van Morrison\, the quintessential Jeff Tain Watts\, the tireless Orri
 
nEvans Captain Black Big Band\, the critically acclaimed Kurt Elling\, incl
 
udingnumerous other jazz veterans\, and newcomers considered tastemakers of
 
 theirgeneration.A prolific leader with sixteen releases to his name\, the 
 
latest being Green Lights(featuring John Patitucci\, Paul Bollenback and Ji
 
mmy Macbride)\, the New YorkCity based Australian immigrant maintains a bus
 
y recording and performanceschedule with his quartet\, his original project
 
 Nu-Jive\, as well as some of thegreatest artists of today. Tickets & info:
 
 https://www.ticketweb.com/event/troy-roberts-quartet-birdland-theater-tick
 
ets/15022923
URL:https://www.ticketweb.com/event/troy-roberts-quartet-birdland-theater-t
 
ickets/15022923
